docs {
  # identity

  Registration, login, token rotation and password recovery (ADR 0007, `docs/domain/identity.md`).

  Happy path, in order: **Register → Verify email → Login → Get current user → Refresh**.

  Before the first run: `pnpm infra:up`, `pnpm infra:provision`,
  `pnpm --filter @ecommerce/identity db:migrate`, then `pnpm dev:identity`.

  ## One-time tokens

  Emails go identity → SQS → notification Lambda → Mailpit. Open http://localhost:8025, copy the
  token from the email (the first one can take ~15 s: Lambda cold start) and paste it into the
  **emailToken** secret variable of the local environment.
}
